  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest golf course positioned in the direction of west from Wildlife West Nature Park, Edgewood, NM?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.202309 35.071827)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'golf_course'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 247.5 AND 292.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
